WEBVTT

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:25.670
Saint Seiya

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:34.340
Beyond tens of billions of light years.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.170
Past immense darkness.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:44.260
The world you reach upstream
the Acheron River.

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:48.530
The infinite pasture near the Lethe River.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:55.370
The utopia only those chosen
by God can enter after death.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.300
Where there is no hunger,
war, suffering or sadness.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:05.990
A haven of eternal peace free from evil.

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:10.080
It is called Elysion.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:18.050
That's Hades.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:23.080
He's finally revealed himself.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:30.530
If we just defeat him,
we can save Miss Saori.

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:35.850
Let's go, Ikki.

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.110
All right!

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.010
The urn.

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.140
The urn with Athena.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.140
Athena!

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.280
Miss Saori!

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:45.400
He's put Athena in front of himself.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:48.010
What does Hades intend to do?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.070
Stop it!

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:03.770
Ikki!

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.630
Seiya.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:07.670
Save Athena.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:27.320
To the World Filled with Light

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:32.220
Saint, if you want to help Athena
don't cause any more trouble.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.290
What?

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:38.530
Don't you see Athena is
still suffering in the urn

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:42.080
after having her blood drained?

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:47.560
I am just trying to release her
from misery with my own hands.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:48.270
What did you say?

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.150
Now, get out of my way.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:56.910
I said get out of my way.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.490
No way. I'll never move.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.350
Especially if you say Athena isn't dead!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:14.790
I won't let you kill Athena.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.300
What a beautiful color of eyes.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:24.090
I can't believe these are the eyes of Hades,

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.620
feared Lord of the Underworld.

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:29.620
They're like a deep spring.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.190
How sad.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:32.680
What?

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:35.200
You humans.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.540
You don't know the limits of your abilities

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:41.180
and always try to do the impossible.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.920
The world given to you by God is not enough.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:48.540
You reach out into the universe
to try to ruin it too.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.670
And in the end...

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:54.030
You challenge God.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:59.530
Humans should fear and worship God.

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:03.280
You have forgotten that respect.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:06.820
I think humans are more sad than foolish.

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:08.830
Nonsense.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.590
Are you saying you are worthy of worship?

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.820
God should be righteous.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:20.290
Where is the righteousness
in a God who murders humans

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.530
and tries to rule the world?

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:34.490
Athena, just Athena.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.560
I won't tell you to move anymore.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:39.040
I'll split you and Athena into two.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:40.580
Die!

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.960
Shiryu, Hyoga, Shun!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.540
Seiya!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:51.760
Are you all right?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:56.330
I'm all right. These are just scratches.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:58.880
Brother!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:02.810
Don't worry, Shun. I'm glad you're all right.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:11.500
Look, even Hades looks a bit
disoriented by your attack.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:12.830
It's our chance.

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:16.910
If we miss this chance we may not
have another one to defeat him.

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:17.990
Brother.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:19.050
Are you ready?

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:20.960
I'm ready to die.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.540
That's right.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.890
Let's go, everyone!

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:27.940
We unite our lives and Cosmo

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:31.090
right now to defeat Hades!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:31.980
Burn!

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:32.900
Rise!

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.700
For justice!

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.550
For the people we love!

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:39.340
Our Cosmo have united into one!

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.700
Destroy Hades!

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.170
Pegasus Meteor!

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.140
Nebula Chain!

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.470
Rising Dragon!

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:46.660
Diamond Dust!

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:47.790
Flying Phoenix!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:53.190
Even united,

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:58.160
mere mortals cannot defeat God.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:58.850
Fools!

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:01.920
What?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.910
No way. The God Cloths!

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.500
I can't believe it.

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:13.480
No way.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:16.540
How could they have wounded me?

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:22.410
And he is still...

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:27.150
Impossible. How many times has he been hit?

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:28.870
That is...

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.630
It was bothering me from the beginning.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:34.710
I've seen that Pegasus somewhere before.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:36.290
Hades.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:37.520
Huh?

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:40.150
Yes, this face.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:43.720
I saw once in the ancient
times, I can't forget.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:48.860
You look just like the
man who wounded my flesh.

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:54.640
And that Saint was also Pegasus.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:58.420
What's wrong, Hades? The
fight isn't over yet.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:05.900
You bastard, did you resurrect from the
ancient times to scar my flesh again?

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:07.620
Unforgivable.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:12.870
I will bury you so you won't
be able to resurrect again.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:16.850
What are you talking about?

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:20.270
You'll be buried first, Hades!

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:21.040
Fool!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:25.010
The strength of a mortal is not
enough, do you still not understand?

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:35.940
The Athena Cloth.

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.310
Not this.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:46.540
What's the point of protecting
that when Athena has perished?

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:49.240
Seiya!

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:50.260
Seiya!

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.900
Quiet, humans.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:59.020
I will show you everything is
over no matter how much you try.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:01.770
Look at the Earth.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.320
What?

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.020
What's this?

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:06.650
It's the sun.

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:11.450
Yes. The sun is completely
covered by the moon.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:14.620
The Greatest Eclipse is complete.

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:19.130
The nine planets that have aligned
on one line will never move again.

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:21.060
Now the Earth is...

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:24.670
In the darkness forever.

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:37.620
Seiya-chan.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:42.750
Shiryu.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:49.740
Is this the end, Athena's Saints?

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:52.490
Marin.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.880
So it didn't work.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:58.480
Any living thing will die one day.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:01.980
We will inevitably be confronted
with death someday.

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:05.040
No one can stop it.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:09.430
Defeating the ruler of
inevitable death, Hades,

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:13.990
might have been impossible
for mortals, after all.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:14.760
No.

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:16.370
You are wrong.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:21.140
I can still hear the voice of Seiya's life.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.170
No, not only Seiya's.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:29.370
I hear the voice of everyone who
has not given up his life yet.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.410
It's a song of joy,

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:32.910
a glimpse of hope.

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:36.510
As long as they are singing the song of life,

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:37.970
I will not give up hope.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:40.730
I will never give up hope.

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:45.550
Now, all your hopes have vanished.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.920
So don't try to resist death this time.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.890
I will not give up.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.400
What?

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:52.580
Seiya!

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:54.730
I will not give up.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:55.940
Seiya.

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:57.860
I will never give up.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.100
Seiya.

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.870
Then I shall offer you a requiem.

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:06.470
Be grateful for I will
personally award you death!

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:08.370
We are Saints of hope!

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:09.970
Die, Pegasus!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:13.250
What? My attack was deflected.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:17.320
Some force is protecting Pegasus.

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:23.190
Ridiculous. It's not only Pegasus.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.890
All the near-death Saints

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.220
are protected by spheres.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:29.510
Hmm?

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:32.170
This is not possible by the hand of mortals.

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:33.200
The one who can do this is...

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:34.850
Athena?

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:39.870
Seiya, Shun, Shiryu, Hyoga, Ikki.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:44.850
Hades cannot touch you as long
as you're in the sphere of life.

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:50.050
It will carry you safely back to earth.

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:52.330
A job well done.

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:56.790
Now, return home to human world.

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.260
What? What is this?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.960
Is blood returning to the body
of Athena inside the urn?

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:08.580
Darn it. I will not let you resurrect now.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:10.920
I will destroy you along with the urn.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.560
Athena, take the Cloth!

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:23.000
Huh? What?

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:28.170
Athena.

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:29.570
Athena.

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:40.370
What? Did you plan this to
lure my body from the tomb?

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:42.610
And you sacrificed yourself

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:45.740
to be trapped into the urn
by the hands of Hypnos?

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:50.520
Hades, our battle has continued
since ancient times.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:52.830
Let's put an end to it now.

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.880
Don't be impudent!

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.100
Miss Saori!

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:02.040
Athena, you are God.

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:05.550
So why do you fight so hard for the humans?

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:10.390
Why are you interrupting another God

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:12.440
from punishing foolish humans?

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:23.130
You're wrong. Humans are not
as foolish as you think.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:27.500
There is nothing more foolish than humans.

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:31.610
If you leave them alone, you don't
know how much damage they'll cause.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:34.450
I need to teach them

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.360
that if they keep misbehaving,
it will lead them

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:40.590
to hell after death, and eternal
suffering will be waiting.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:45.400
Because of the fear after death I designed,

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:48.590
the world anyhow exists today.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.040
Hades.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:53.580
That is your arrogance.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:55.300
Huh? What?

00:14:55.670 --> 00:15:00.160
Is there a human who can live life

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:03.780
without killing an insect or a plant?

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.700
Humans aren't Gods.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.950
So even a good person

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:12.700
will commit small sins without intention.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:16.040
That is what it means to live.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:19.300
It is something unavoidable in life.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:25.070
But even those sins are paid for by death.

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:32.140
For all living things good and bad,

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:34.770
won't death come and equally put them

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:37.980
in a peaceful eternal sleep?

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:43.440
But punishing them after death for sins
they committed in former life is...

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:47.160
Hades, you are wrong.

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:48.970
Shut up!

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:52.100
Athena!

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:53.370
Athena!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:54.710
Athena.

00:15:55.570 --> 00:16:00.030
I hold no reservations against
you who protects the mortals.

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:02.580
There is no need for further discussion.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:05.540
Now, die for the humans.

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:06.770
Miss Saori!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.180
Seiya!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.140
What?

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:11.920
Pegasus Meteor!

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:13.120
What?

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:24.270
Impossible.

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:25.810
I can't believe...

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:29.180
A human can hurt me this much.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.710
Seiya, you did it!

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:39.240
He damaged Hades for the first time.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:43.080
We can finish Hades now.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.500
That's right, we can get him now.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:47.650
What's that?

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:54.720
Seiya!

00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:57.240
Seiya.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.150
Get a hold of yourself, Seiya.

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.550
Your sister is waiting on Earth.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.050
Athena...

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.330
Sister.

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:08.380
Seiya!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:10.410
You can't die!

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:15.630
Live for the people who love you.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:17.910
Please, Seiya!

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:23.160
Seiya's Cosmo.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.710
His Cosmo is disappearing.

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:26.690
Athena.

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:29.210
You've became foolish yourself

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:32.350
while mingling with the humans.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:35.560
You've blown the only chance

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:37.670
to defeat me.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:43.140
That one chance Pegasus
created with his life.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.610
You were overwhelmed by emotion,

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.900
and you let it get away.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:57.370
Pegasus was ultimately useless after all,

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:01.520
to jump to his own death
after being resurrected.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.880
Such a foolish man.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.010
Hades...

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.870
Do you know love?

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:10.700
What?

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.810
It's true, from God's perspective,

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:18.710
humans may seem hopeless
and a helpless existence.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.670
But they possess love.

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:30.030
For love, humans can become
infinitely compassionate

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.370
and infinitely strong.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.600
Even if you are a God,
you have no right to kill

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:38.070
a human if you do not know love.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.930
Athena, is that all you have to say?

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:44.360
Then die knowing that

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:46.050
love is powerless!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.230
We won't let you attack Athena!

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:55.490
What? What is this Cosmo?

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:56.830
Unbelievable.

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:01.060
They're virtually dead, yet
their Cosmo surpasses mine.

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:08.990
Hades, this is love.

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:11.490
The great power humans possess.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:15.340
The power of love, from the center of life.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:19.020
It won't be defeated by anything.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.650
It can't be.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:31.040
Yes, finally!

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:33.020
Hades has been defeated!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.350
Did you see, Seiya?

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:35.820
We won!

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:41.140
Impossible.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:45.260
I, who reign over death, a God,

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:48.470
has been defeated in the Underworld.

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:51.440
Unbelievable. Unbelievable.

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:57.340
However, if I perish,

00:19:57.350 --> 00:20:00.680
the Underworld I made will also disappear.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:03.880
Hell, Elysion, all of it.

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:09.360
Athena...

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:13.260
All of you will also be wiped out

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:16.580
along with this world.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:24.820
After all, it isn't a perfect
victory for the humans.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:26.310
Athena...

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:30.160
Goddess, when will you realize?

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:34.830
Love is but an illusion that humans created.

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.390
Love, which cannot be seen...

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.960
No one really believes such a thing.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.290
No one.

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:05.470
Master Julian, the sun!

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:07.290
Yes.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:12.150
Oh! Look, the sun!

